<title>UK: Birse Group slides after profits warning.</title>
<headline>Birse Group slides after profits warning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Birse Group Plc plunged 6p, or 24 percent, to 19-1/4p by 0935 GMT after the plant hire to property development company issued a profits warning, market makers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The company slipped in a profits warning after the market closed last Friday. That has done the damage,&quot; one market maker said.</p>
<p>On Friday, the company said profit achieved in the current financial year would be &quot;well below current market expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
